# check_wiring on COM11 @ 115200

[loopback]   success=True  raw=-
             no echo (expected for Roomba — Tx is connected only to the robot, not back to our Rx).
[awake-try]  success=False  raw=-
             no reply within 1 s.
[wake+DTR]   success=True  raw=01  banner=0 B
             OI mode reply = 1 after BRC pulse. Wiring confirmed; DTR is connected to BRC.

PASS: Rx/Tx and ground are correctly wired. The Roomba was asleep; pulsing DTR low (BRC wake) woke it up. OI mode reply = 1 after BRC pulse. Wiring confirmed; DTR is connected to BRC.